      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$E = (2x + 3)^2 - (x + 1)^2$",
          "$E = (2x)^2 + 2 \\times 2x \\times 3 + 3^2 - \\left[x^2 + 2 \\times x \\times 1 + 1^2\\right]$",
          "$E = 4x^2 + 12x + 9 - (x^2 + 2x + 1)$",
          "$E = 4x^2 + 12x + 9 - x^2 - 2x - 1$"
        ],
        "result": "E = 3x^2 + 10x + 8"
      },
